[{"answer":"Hello, Kira, how are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine thanks, Paul, how are you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's good to see you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"It must be 12 months since you did our course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It's nice to come back and say hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"What course did you enroll in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I went straight into third year Pharmacy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"They credited me with two years, which probably made it more difficult for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"On the other hand, you were lucky to be granted credits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that why you chose the course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And, as I'd already finished a course in it in my country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it would be easier if I studied something I already knew.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't realise you went into third year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought you started in first year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"No wonder it was so hard!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And what do you think is one of the big differences between studying at a university here and studying in your country?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've found it very difficult to write assignments,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"because I wasn't familiar with that aspect of the system here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"The main problem is that the lecturers expect you to be critical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"That made me feel really terrible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought \"How can I possibly do it?\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"\"How can I comment on someone else's research when they probably spent five years doing it?\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I think a lot of people who come from overseas countries have similar problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"But after a while, it became easier for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"People expect you to have problems with the process of reading and writing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"but, in fact, it is more a question of altering your viewpoint towards academic study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"How was the content of the lectures?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Was it easy for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't really have many problems understanding lectures.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"The content was very similar to what I'd studied before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about the lecturers themselves?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they essentially the same as lecturers in your country?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, actually, no.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Here, they're much easier to approach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"After every lecture, you can go and ask them something you didn't understand.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Or you can make an appointment and talk to them about anything in the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe you found them different because you're a more mature student now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"whereas when you were studying in your country, you were younger and not so assertive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I don't think that's the difference.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Most of the students here do it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"In my faculty, they all seem to make appointments -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"usually to talk about something in the course that's worrying them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"but sometimes just about something that might really interest them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"something they might want to specialise in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"The lecturers must set aside certain times every week when they're available for students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good to hear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And how was your timetable?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Was it a very busy year?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Very, very busy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"They make you work very hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Apart from lectures, we had practical sessions in a lot of subjects.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"We did these in small groups.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to go and work four hours every week in a community pharmacy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I enjoyed this very much - meeting new people all the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Then in second semester, we had to get experience in hospital dispensaries,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/58.mp3"},{"answer":"so every second day we went to one of the big hospitals and worked there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/59.mp3"},{"answer":"And on top of all that we had our assignments,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/60.mp3"},{"answer":"which took me a lot of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I nearly forgot, between first and second semesters,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/62.mp3"},{"answer":"we had to work full-time for two weeks in a hospital.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/63.mp3"},{"answer":"That does sound a very heavy year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/64.mp3"},{"answer":"So are you pleased now that you did it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you feel some sense of achievement?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I do feel much more confident,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/67.mp3"},{"answer":"which I suppose is the most important thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And have you got any recommendations for people who are studying from overseas?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I suppose they need very good English.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be much better if they spent more time learning English before they enter the university,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/71.mp3"},{"answer":"because you can be in big trouble if you don't understand what people are saying","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/72.mp3"},{"answer":"and you haven't got time to translate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as I said before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/75.mp3"},{"answer":"the biggest problem for me was a lack of familiarity with the education system here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/76.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds as if it was a real challenge.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Congratulations, Kira.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, Paul.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-3-2023-07-24-14-49-42/79.mp3"}]
